Civic Pulse Monitor (Smart City Ops)


Geospatial Graph Intelligence & Local Llama 3


A privacy-first Smart City architecture running entirely offline. Traditional hazard systems treat civic reports as context-blind rows in a database. Civic Pulse gives them a memory.
The Workflow: This system federates structured civic logs with unstructured geospatial data. It utilizes local Llama 3 inference to semantically understand a hazard report, and then strictly validates that hazard against a Neo4j knowledge graph to determine true priority.

